messages.content:
We need a solopreneur view. It will be used for solopreneur mode defined by /solopreneur route path.

Find attached the mockups. Analyze and create a document with the structure, components, funcionalities and a proposal for implementation.

@Mockups Create a mockup exactly like the screenshots

I'll start by exploring the project structure and looking for any existing mockups, templates, or solopreneur-related code.I have enough context. Let me summarize what I found before proposing changes.

**Info gathered (from the repo, not guessed):**
- App is Vue 3 + Vuex (`typed-vuex`) + DaisyUI/Tailwind 4, dark-first (`src/assets/main.css`, `data-theme` on `App.vue`).
- Routing is a single catch-all: `src/router/index.ts` → `{ path: '/*', component: DesktopView }`. So `/solopreneur` today would render the desktop Dockview shell.
- Store modules live in `src/store/*` (`views.js`, `projects.js`, …), API layer in `src/api/api.js`, views in `src/views/*`, feature components in `src/components/<feature>/*`.
- There is a docs (`vitepress`) surface at repo root + `wiki/codx-junior-ui.features.md`.

**Screen outline (from the two mockups)**
- App Shell: sidebar (brand, user, 6 nav items, log out, footer) + sticky topbar (greeting + date, search, language, primary CTA).
- Summary: `Your account` · `Wallet` · `At a glance` (4 metrics) · `Your projects` (3 gradient tiles) · `Tasks for today` · `Latest updates` · `Quick messages` · sticky `Calendar`.
- Secondary screens reachable from the same shell: Account, Projects, Wallet, Updates, Messages.

**Mock API contract (invented, REST-shaped)**

| Method | Path | Payload |
|---|---|---|
| GET | `/api/solopreneur/summary` | `{ user, wallet, stats, projects[], tasks[], updates[], events[], messages[] }` |
| GET/PATCH | `/api/solopreneur/account` | `User` |
| GET/POST | `/api/solopreneur/projects` | `Project[]` / `{ name, tasks }` |
| GET | `/api/solopreneur/wallet` | `{ wallet, invoices[] }` |
| POST | `/api/solopreneur/wallet/credits` | `{ pack }` → `{ wallet, invoices }` |
| PATCH | `/api/solopreneur/wallet/plan` | `{ plan }` → `{ wallet, user }` |
| GET | `/api/solopreneur/updates` · POST `/updates/read` | `Update[]` |
| GET/POST | `/api/solopreneur/messages` | `Message[]` / `{ text }` |
| POST | `/api/solopreneur/tasks/:id/(complete\|reopen)` | `{ tasks, projects }` |

**Files to be created:** `mockups/solopreneur.html` (runnable mockup) and `wiki/solopreneur-view.md` (analysis + implementation proposal).

